  "notes": "Curated cases for the tenancy-eviction (Delhi Rent Control Act, 1958) complaint-drafter scenario. Each case runs the actual Pydantic validator + clause-selector + citation-resolution pipeline in complaint_drafter.py -- nothing here is mocked. Section 3 of the Act reads 'monthly rent exceeds three thousand and five hundred rupees' -- 'exceeds' is strictly-greater-than, so the cap is EXCLUSIVE: a rent of exactly Rs. 3,500 is still covered by the Act (case boundary_rent_at_cap_is_covered), and only a rent strictly above Rs. 3,500 falls outside it (case boundary_rent_just_above_cap_is_excluded).",
